## 7. UI 模式

### ISPanel 派生

```lua
MyUI = ISPanel:derive("MyUI")

function MyUI:new(x, y, w, h)
    local o = ISPanel:new(x, y, w, h)
    setmetatable(o, self)
    self.__index = self
    o.borderColor = { r = 0.5, g = 0.5, b = 0.5, a = 1 }
    o.backgroundColor = { r = 0, g = 0, b = 0, a = 0.85 }
    return o
end

function MyUI:initialise()
    ISPanel.initialise(self)
    self:create()
end

function MyUI:prerender()
    ISPanel.prerender(self)
    self:drawRectBorder(0, 0, self.width, self.height, 0.8, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4)
    self:drawTextCentre("Title", self.width / 2, 7, 1, 1, 1, 1, UIFont.Medium)
end
```

### 拖拽窗口

```lua
function MyUI:onMouseDown(x, y)
    if y < 28 then
        self.dragging = true
        self.dragOfsX = getMouseX() - self.x
        self.dragOfsY = getMouseY() - self.y
        return true
    end
end

function MyUI:onMouseMove(x, y)
    if self.dragging then
        self.x = getMouseX() - self.dragOfsX
        self.y = getMouseY() - self.dragOfsY
    end
end

function MyUI:onMouseUp(x, y)
    self.dragging = false
end
```

### ISTextBox 输入弹窗

```lua
local modal = ISTextBox:new(0, 0, 400, 200,
    "Prompt text", "default value", nil,
    function(target, button)
        if button.internal == "OK" then
            local text = button.parent.entry:getText()
        end
    end)
modal:initialise()
modal:addToUIManager()
```

### XML 布局（EventTrigger）

```lua
local function LoadLayout()
    local ok, layout = pcall(function()
        return getXML("media/ui/EventTriggerLayout.xml")
    end)
    if not ok then
        return DefaultLayout()  -- pcall 回退硬编码
    end
    -- 解析 layout...
end
```

### ISCollapsableWindow（AVCS42）

AVCS42 的 UI 继承自 `ISCollapsableWindow`（可折叠窗口），附带默认标题栏和关闭按钮。

### 3D 模型预览（AVCS42）

```lua
-- ISUI3DScene 渲染车辆 3D 预览
-- 通过 javaObject:fromLua1/2 调用 Java 3D 渲染管线
```

### 安全移除 UI

BulletinBoard 的 `MultiLineEditor` 用 `OnTick` 延迟一帧移除：

```lua
local function deferredRemove()
    self:removeFromUIManager()
    Events.OnTick.Remove(deferredRemove)
end
Events.OnTick.Add(deferredRemove)
```

