## 8. 玩家检测与 Tick 系统

### OnTick 模式

```lua
EventTrigger.tickCounter = 0
EventTrigger.timers = {}

function EventTrigger.OnTick()
    EventTrigger.tickCounter = EventTrigger.tickCounter + 1

    -- 每 300 tick（~5 秒）扫描
    if EventTrigger.tickCounter % 300 == 0 then
        EventTrigger.RebuildList()
    end

    -- 遍历所有玩家
    local idx = 0
    while true do
        local player = getSpecificPlayer(idx)
        if not player then break end
        -- 每个触发的距离检测
        idx = idx + 1
    end

    ProcessTimers()
end
```

### 距离计算

```lua
local dx, dy, dz = px - target.x, py - target.y, pz - target.z
local dist = math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy + dz * dz)
local inRange = dist < range
```

WoWB4213 的跨楼层处理：`dz >= 2` 时返回 999（防止跨楼层交互）。

### 范围进入/离开检测

```lua
if inRange then
    if not inRangePlayers[playerKey] then
        inRangePlayers[playerKey] = true
        -- 触发进入（只一次）
    end
else
    if inRangePlayers[playerKey] then
        inRangePlayers[playerKey] = nil
        -- 触发离开（只一次）
    end
end
```

### EveryOneMinute 替代方案

WoWB4213 和 ssr_news 使用 `Events.EveryOneMinute` 而非 `OnTick`，开销更低：

```lua
Events.EveryOneMinute.Add(function()
    if scanCounter % 2 == 0 then ScanWorld() end
    scanCounter = scanCounter + 1
end)
```

### 计时器/延迟系统

```lua
local timers = {}
local tickCounter = 0

function ScheduleMessage(delayFrames, callback)
    local id = "timer_" .. tickCounter .. "_" .. timerIdCounter
    timers[id] = {
        endTick = tickCounter + delayFrames,
        callback = callback,
    end
end

function ProcessTimers()
    for id, timer in pairs(timers) do
        if tickCounter >= timer.endTick then
            timer.callback()
            timers[id] = nil
        end
    end
end
```

