## 13. Vanilla 覆写模式

AVCS42 覆写了 20+ 原版函数来保护已索赔车辆。这是 B42 中实现"权限系统"的标准模式。

### 阻止操作模式

```lua
-- 创建一个零时长的"拒绝"动作
ISAVCSDeniedTimedAction = ISBaseTimedAction:derive("ISAVCSDeniedTimedAction")

function ISAVCSDeniedTimedAction:new(character, msg)
    local o = ISBaseTimedAction.new(self, character)
    o.maxTime = 1
    o.stopOnWalk = false
    o.stopOnRun = false
    if msg and character then
        character:setHaloNote(msg, 250, 250, 250, 300)
    end
    return o
end
```

### 覆写原版操作

```lua
local origNew = ISEnterVehicle.new
ISEnterVehicle.new = function(character, vehicle, ...)
    local details = AVCS.checkPermission(character, vehicle)
    if details and not details.canDrive then
        return AVCS_DenyTimed(character)  -- 拒绝进入驾驶座
    end
    return origNew(character, vehicle, ...)
end
```

### 覆写的操作类型（AVCS42 清单）

| 覆写                                    | 权限检查                    |
| --------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| `ISEnterVehicle.new`                    | AllowDrive / AllowPassenger |
| `ISSwitchVehicleSeat.new`               | 座位切换权限                |
| `ISAttachTrailerToVehicle.new`          | AllowAttachVehicle          |
| `ISDetachTrailerFromVehicle.new`        | AllowDetechVehicle          |
| `ISUninstallVehiclePart.new`            | AllowUninstallParts         |
| `ISTakeGasolineFromVehicle.new`         | AllowSiphonFuel             |
| `ISTakeEngineParts.new`                 | AllowTakeEngineParts        |
| `ISDeflateTire.new`                     | AllowDeflatTires            |
| `ISSmashVehicleWindow.new`              | 窗口权限                    |
| `ISOpenVehicleDoor.new`                 | AllowOpeningTrunk           |
| `ISInventoryTransferAction`             | 所有容器访问                |
| `ISInventoryPaneContext.createMenu`     | 右键菜单屏蔽                |
| `ISInventoryPane.transferItemsByWeight` | Take All 屏蔽               |
| `ISInventoryPane.onMouseDown/Up`        | 拖拽屏蔽                    |
| `ISInventoryPane.doDoubleClick`         | 双击打开屏蔽                |
| `ISMouseDrag.transferItems`             | 拖拽传输屏蔽                |

