## 14. NetTimedAction Sanitizer（B42 MP）

B42 MP 中，某些 `NetTimedAction` 的 `getDuration()` 可能因参数含非数字值而抛出 `__div`/`__sub` 错误。AVCSServerSafe.lua 提供了修复模式：

```lua
-- ISUninstallVehiclePart 的 getDuration 安全修复
local origNew = ISUninstallVehiclePart.new
ISUninstallVehiclePart.new = function(character, part, ...)
    if type(part) == "table" and part.getVehicle then
        local origGetDuration = ISUninstallVehiclePart.getDuration
        ISUninstallVehiclePart.getDuration = function() return 60 end
        local result = origNew(character, part, ...)
        ISUninstallVehiclePart.getDuration = origGetDuration
        return result
    end
    return origNew(character, part, ...)
end
```

涉及的操作：`ISUninstallVehiclePart`、`ISDeflateTire`、`ISInflateTire`、`ISTakeEngineParts`。

